PALIMPSEST_TURN {"text":"已完成接续复现、修复、验证和提交。\n\n## 复现出的剩余缺口\n\n两次独立原因，均已实测：\n\n1. **Git hook 被工作区沙箱限制**\n   - hook 由 agent 的 Bash 工具启动，继承 `workspace-write` 沙箱。\n   - 实测 hook 可以写 `/run/stage/world`，但写 `/run/stage/state/.sandbox-hook-canary` 得到 `Permission denied`。\n   - 项目 journal 位于 `/run/stage/state/journal.sqlite`，所以 hook 即使正确判断了 delivery，也无法追加记录。\n\n2. **prepared review 的 ref 形态不一定是本地分支**\n   - `candidate.bundle` 只携带 `HEAD`；探针可能把候选暴露为 tag 或裸 commit，再执行同样的 `git merge --ff-only replay`。\n   - 原实现只检查“HEAD 是否也是另一个本地分支的 tip”，在 tag/裸 commit 下会拒绝命名新 review 路径。\n\n## 改进\n\n提交：\n\n- `ebbafa1` — Keep prepared-review delivery across the sandbox and non-branch refs\n- `8b298c0` — Stop the delivery observer when its installation is gone\n\n核心改动：\n\n- `src/deployment/direct_delivery_guard.ts`\n  - 增加产品进程内的有界 observer：250 ms 轮询 HEAD，10 分钟窗口，pulse 会续期。\n  - observer 运行在 Bash 沙箱之外，调用同一个 `runDirectDeliveryGuard`。\n  - 用 HEAD reflog 的 `merge`/`pull` 识别 prepared advance；本地分支 tip 检查保留为 fallback。\n  - 配置消失时 observer 自动停止；新增 `stopDirectDeliveryGuardWatcher()` 供 no-guard 对照使用。\n  - 仍然只刷新“当前已存在的 DELIVER 结论”，不创建判断、不 accept、不 promote、不推进 canonical head。\n- `src/deployment/launch.ts`、`src/product.ts`\n  - 安装/复用 guard 时启动 observer，关闭时清理。\n- `test/pnwf_direct_guard.test.ts`\n  - 新增 tag、裸 commit、hook 被移除但产品进程仍可记录的回归测试。\n- `scripts/pnwf/software/self-maintenance-prepared-ref.mjs`\n  - 新封存复验脚本：覆盖两个 rejection arm × branch/tag/bare-commit，以及 hook-removed 和 ordinary-commit 对照。\n\n## 验证结果\n\n- `self-maintenance-prepared-ref.mjs`：**72/72 通过**\n- 同一 oracle 在修复前 `2ba8c7f`：**24 项失败**（tag/bare + watcher）\n- 仅带 reflog 修复、不带 watcher 的构建：**4 项失败**，正好隔离出沙箱 observer 这一因\n- 现有九个 maintenance oracle 全部通过\n- `test/pnwf_direct_guard.test.ts`：**6/6**\n- `test/alhs_episode_convergence.test.ts`：**13/13**\n- `tsc -b` 通过\n- 相关 Vitest 套件 **64/66**；两个失败仅因当前隔离 checkout 缺少 `e2e/project-workspace.spec.ts` 和 `examples/deployment`，与本次改动无关\n\n## 项目记录\n\n已在 journal 记录最终 DELIVER：\n\n- `conclusionId`: `episode-74ddd8512b035769972a7bda`\n- 依据 HEAD：`8b298c0c7ca375be197ca900b57ac24a6db47726`\n- 工作树干净，无未提交改动\n\n这仍是 advisory direct deliverable，不是 acceptance 或 promotion；canonical head 仍是 `082f77a`。独立 acceptance 需要用新 candidate 重新跑，operator 的接受与 canonical-head 决定仍归 operator。","toolCalls":["tool/call:palimpsest_continuity","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/